<title>INDIA: Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</title>
<headline>Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are monthly annualised interest rates on forward dollar premia quoted by banks and brokers at 1600 IST. The rates are spot/one month to spot/six months.</p>
<p>	    O/N =  Par			   O/N = Par</p>
<p>	    T/N =  Par			   T/N = Par</p>
<p>		   Dec  10, 1996			Dec  9, 1996</p>
<p>	  1 month forward =  5.77%	1 month forward =  5.43%</p>
<p>	  2 month forward =  6.45%	2 month forward =  6.27%</p>
<p>	  3 month forward =  6.67%	3 month forward =  6.78%</p>
<p>	  4 month forward =  7.29%	4 month forward =  7.38%</p>
<p>	  5 month forward =  7.53%	5 month forward =  7.60%</p>
<p>	  6 month forward =  7.41%	6 month forward =  7.47%</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom, 91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
